# WhoKan - Skill Discovery Platform

WhoKan is a platform that helps organizations discover and leverage internal expertise. Users can list their skills, search for colleagues with specific skills, request help, and track help provided.

## Features

- User authentication and profile management
- Skill listing and management
- Skill discovery and search
- Help request system
- Help tracking and confirmation
- Profile ranking based on help provided

